<title>JAPAN: Bank of Yokohama forgives loans to mortgage firms.</title>
<headline>Bank of Yokohama forgives loans to mortgage firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Yokohama Ltd said on Tuesday it had forgiven 115.9 billion yen in loans to Nippon Housing Loan Co Ltd and Chigin-Seiho Housing Loan on September 30.</p>
<p>It said the move would not affect its earnings for the 1996/97 business year ending on March 31.</p>
</text>
